#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:6
msgid ""
"When you generate a map, MapServer automatically performs multiple tasks."
" It annotates features and prevents conflicts between adjacent "
"dimensions. It provides the use of bitmapped and TrueType fonts."
msgstr "生成地图时，MapServer会自动执行多个任务。它可以注释特征并防止相邻尺寸之间的冲突。它提供位图和TrueType字体的使用。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:16
msgid ""
"MapServer has a very flexible annotation engine. It supports local "
"bitmaps and TrueType fonts. Font scaling uses TrueType support. The angle"
" and placement of the dimensions can be customized."
msgstr "MapServer有一个非常灵活的注释引擎。它支持本地位图和TrueType字体。字体缩放使用TrueType支持。尺寸的角度和位置可以自定义。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:24
