#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:83
msgid ""
"Here, we specify the file for the list of TrueType fonts (or the full "
"path set of fonts). This file lists each available font. See the file "
"itself and the MapFile reference for more information. The MAP object of "
"FONTSET is a parameter."
msgstr ""
"在这里，我们为TrueType字体列表(或字体的完整路径集)指定文件。该文件列出了每种可用的字体。有关详细信息，请参见文件本身和《 Mapfile"
" 参考》。FONTSET的map对象是一个参数。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:88
msgid "The contents of this file are as follows:"
msgstr "此文件的内容如下："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:95
msgid "``LABELITEM``"
msgstr "``LABELITEM``"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:97
msgid ""
"In the ``\"STATE\"`` case, the specified data attribute is used for the "
"annotation. ``LABELITEM`` is a parameter of the layer object."
msgstr "在  ``\"STATE\"`` 情况下，指定的数据属性用于批注。  ``LABELITEM`` 是Layer对象的参数。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:100
msgid ""
"``LABEL`` Marks the beginning of the definition ``LABEL`` Object. "
"Dimension objects can be used for other objects (that is, scale bar "
"objects)"
msgstr "``LABEL`` 标志着定义的开始  ``LABEL`` 物体。标注对象可用于其他对象(即比例尺对象)"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:104
msgid ""
"``COLOR`` objects within the callout, color specifies the color of the "
"callout text."
msgstr "``COLOR`` 对象，则指定详图索引文本的颜色。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:106
msgid "``SHADOWCOLOR`` specifies the shadow color for dimension text."
msgstr "``SHADOWCOLOR`` 指定标注文字的阴影颜色。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:107
msgid ""
"``SHADOWSIZE`` specifies the size of the shadow. This value corresponds "
"to the transition of pixels at ``X`` and ``Y``. Therefore, ``2`` means "
"two pixels wide by two pixels high."
msgstr "``SHADOWSIZE`` 指定阴影的大小。该值对应于  ``X`` 和  ``Y`` 。因此，  ``2`` 表示两个像素宽乘两个像素高。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:110
msgid ""
"``TYPE`` in the LABEL object, the type specifies what type of font to "
"use. We have a choice of TrueType or Bitmap (built-in fonts). We choose "
"``TRUETYPE`` ."
msgstr ""
"``TYPE`` 在标签对象中，类型指定要使用的字体类型。我们有TrueType或Bitmap(内置字体)可供选择。我们选择  "
"``TRUETYPE`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:113
msgid ""
"``FONT`` If specified as TrueType, you need to specify what font to use. "
"The value mentioned here is “alias”; the “alias” in the font list file."
msgstr "``FONT`` 如果指定为TrueType，则需要指定要使用的字体。这里提到的值是“alias”；字体列表文件中的“alias”。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:116
msgid ""
"``SIZE`` If using a TrueType font, the value in pixels is the size of the"
" dimension. If it’s a bitmap, say something like “small” or “big”."
msgstr "``SIZE`` 如果使用TrueType字体，则以像素为单位的值是尺寸大小。如果是位图，就说“小”或“大”之类的东西。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:119
msgid ""
"``ANTIALIAS`` This turns truetype antialiasing on or off. Remember that "
"the value is not ``OPEN`` or ``CLOSE`` , but ``TRUE`` or ``FALSE`` ."
msgstr ""
"``ANTIALIAS`` 这将打开或关闭Truetype抗锯齿。请记住，该值不是  ``OPEN`` 或  ``CLOSE`` ，但  "
"``TRUE`` 或  ``FALSE`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:122
msgid ""
"``POSITION`` locates the label point of the label text. The value is a "
"combined vertical and horizontal position. You have the following "
"options: ``C`` for center vertical alignment, ``U`` for upper, and ``L`` "
"for lower. For horizontal alignment you have the following options: ``C``"
" for center, ``L`` for left, and ``R`` for right. Therefore, to call the "
"center of the callout ID for the text alignment, use the value ``CC`` "
"(center - center). Or, if you wanted it to be the ID at the bottom left, "
"you would use ``LL`` . Another approach is to let MapServer decide the "
"best location for the label. For this, you can use the ``AUTO`` value."
msgstr ""
"``POSITION`` 定位标签文本的标签点。该值是垂直和水平位置的组合。您有以下选项：  ``C`` 对于中心垂直对齐，  ``U`` "
"对于上层，和  ``L`` 越低越好。对于水平对齐，您有以下选项：  ``C`` 对于中锋，  ``L`` 用于左侧，以及  ``R`` "
"这是对的。因此，要调用标注ID的中心进行文本对齐，请使用值  ``CC`` (中心-中心)。或者，如果您希望它是左下角的ID，您可以使用  "
"``LL`` 。另一种方法是让MapServer决定标签的最佳位置。为此，您可以使用  ``AUTO`` 价值。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:132
msgid ""
"``PARTIALS`` tells MapServer whether to generate incomplete label text. "
"The default here is to not generate fragments of the label text. The "
"value is ``TRUE`` or ``FALSE`` ."
msgstr ""
"``PARTIALS`` 告知MapServer是否生成不完整的标签文本。这里的默认设置是不生成标签文本的片段。该值为  ``TRUE`` 或  "
"``FALSE`` 。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:135
msgid ""
"``MINDISTANCE`` is the minimum distance, in pixels, between duplicate "
"annotations. See what happens if you increase or decrease the value."
msgstr "``MINDISTANCE`` 重复批注之间的最小距离(以像素为单位)。查看如果增大或减小该值会发生什么情况。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:138
msgid ""
"``BUFFER`` Padding (pixels) of the callout. This is used to improve "
"readability. A buffer of 4 pixels means that no labels will be drawn over"
" the four pixels of each other. Again, change and see how it works."
msgstr ""
"``BUFFER`` "
"标注的填充(像素)。这用于提高可读性。4个像素的缓冲区意味着不会在彼此的4个像素上绘制任何标签。再说一次，改变一下，看看它是如何运作的。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:143
msgid ""
"You can also create dimensions to separate a polygon layer. You do it "
"with the data type of the annotation. Take a look at the MapFile of the "
"following example to see how you implement this tagging. You will find "
"that the “annotation” layer within the class object has color parameter "
"values. ``-1 -1 -1`` . Negative numbers tell MapServer to give this class"
" a transparent color (the callout logo is not displayed). Again, modify "
"these values and view the results to see how it affects the map."
msgstr ""
"还可以创建标注来分隔多边形层。您可以使用注释的数据类型来执行此操作。查看以下示例的MapFile，了解如何实现此标记。您将发现类对象中的“注解”层具有颜色参数值。"
"  ``-1 -1 -1`` 。负数告诉MapServer为此类提供透明颜色(不显示标注徽标)。同样，修改这些值并查看结果，以了解它如何影响地图。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:152
msgid "Automatic optimization of annotations"
msgstr "注释的自动优化"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:154
msgid ""
"To prevent the map from looking cluttered, MapServer optimizes the "
"labeling according to the scale of the data."
msgstr "为了避免地图看起来杂乱无章，MapServer根据数据的比例优化了标注。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:160
msgid "Annotation processing"
msgstr "批注处理"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec08_labels/section.rst:162
msgid ""
"Since version 6.2, MapServer has been able to draw label lines for "
"functions that are problematic in the label space (usually when the label"
" text is larger than the marked polygon). This feature is done through "
"the addition of MS RFC 81: offset labels with leaders. This feature is "
"for polygon annotations only."
msgstr ""
"从6.2版开始，MapServer可以为标签空间中有问题的函数绘制标签线(通常在标签文本大于标记的多边形时)。此功能通过添加MS RFC "
"81：带引线的偏移标签来实现。此功能仅适用于多边形注释。"

