#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec10_projection/section.rst:58
msgid "Writing way of Mapfile"
msgstr "Mapfile的编写方式"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec10_projection/section.rst:60
msgid ""
"Projection can be defined in MAP objects, as well as in LAYER objects. "
"Projections can be defined in MAP objects (only once, but multiple can be"
" defined) This defined projection is the output projection of the map, "
"and MapServer will use this projection to render the map result. The "
"projection defined in the ``LAYER`` object is the input projection, that "
"is, the projection of the data corresponding to the layer object. The "
"definition of the projection in the layer object can be different from "
"that in the map object, and MapServer will do the projection "
"transformation and reproject to the output projection. If there is no "
"projection information in the ``LAYER`` object, MapServer will assume "
"that the input and output projections are the same."
msgstr ""
"投影可以在地图对象中定义，也可以在层对象中定义。可以在地图对象中定义投影(只能定义一次，但可以定义多个)此定义的投影是地图的输出投影，MapServer将使用此投影来呈现地图结果。中定义的投影"
"  ``LAYER`` "
"对象是输入投影，即层对象对应的数据的投影。Layer对象中的投影定义可以与地图对象中的投影定义不同，MapServer将进行投影转换并重新投影到输出投影。中没有投影信息。"
"  ``LAYER`` 对象时，MapServer将假定输入和输出投影相同。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec10_projection/section.rst:72
msgid ""
"In a Mapfile, the ``PROJECTION`` object is not required. But if you want "
"to support the OGC interoperability specification (WMS/WFS/WCS), it still"
" needs to be clearly defined in the Mapfile."
msgstr ""
"在映射文件中，  ``PROJECTION`` "
"对象不是必需的。但是，如果您想要支持OGC互操作性规范(WMS/WFS/WCS)，则仍然需要在映射文件中对其进行明确定义。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec10_projection/section.rst:76
msgid ""
"Defined only once in the map object, this definition becomes your output "
"projection - MapServer will render your map in this projection. You can "
"also define input projections using projection object layer objects. It "
"is possible to project on different layers - MapServer reprojects them to"
" your output projection. If no objects within the projection layer are "
"defined, MapServer assumes that the input projection is the same as the "
"output projection. This is not the desired object unless you create a map"
" file that supports an OGC Interoperable Web Services Specification "
"(WMS/WFS/WCS)."
msgstr "此定义仅在地图对象中定义一次，即成为您的输出投影-MapServer将在此投影中呈现您的地图。也可以使用投影对象层对象定义输入投影。可以在不同的层上投影-MapServer将它们重新投影到您的输出投影。如果未定义投影层中的对象，则MapServer会假定输入投影与输出投影相同。除非您创建支持OGC可互操作Web服务规范(WMS/WFS/WCS)的映射文件，否则这不是所需的对象。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb2_using-mapserver/sec10_projection/section.rst:86
